      "updated": 1780293715458,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Each node announces AND listens over the chosen transport - Wi-Fi/hotspot (mDNS) on a shared network, or Bluetooth (BLE) with no network at all.\nNo server, no pairing. One node alone -> empty list; a second node -> both discover each other. Resolved peers share one DiscoveredPeer shape regardless of transport.\nSource: crates/proximity/src/mdns.rs (Wi-Fi) - crates/proximity/src/ble.rs (Bluetooth) - crates/proximity/src/discovery.rs",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each node announces AND listens over the chosen transport - Wi-Fi/hotspot (mDNS) on a shared network, or Bluetooth (BLE) with no network at all.\nNo server, no pairing. One node alone -> empty list; a second node -> both discover each other. Resolved peers share one DiscoveredPeer shape regardless of transport.\nSource: crates/proximity/src/mdns.rs (Wi-Fi) - crates/proximity/src/ble.rs (Bluetooth) - crates/proximity/src/discovery.rs",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 45,
      "versionNonce": 585204612,
      "index": "aJ",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "autoResize": true
    }
